{"obsah":"<p>This weekend we ran the last Bikeskills weekend camps. Both the women's and men's camps brought together a decent group of riders who wanted to improve and progress – each within their own abilities, of course.</p>\n\n<p>After the morning basics, pump track, berms and – for the men – jumps, we moved to the nearby Marvánek swimming pool for lunch and then along our traditional route, where we have various technical spots ready, from drops and Trial to descents for riders of all levels.&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p>Many thanks to all participants for their effort, their patience with our explanations and the appreciation at the end. Hopefully Vlasta, Katarína and Matouš passed something on to you.</p>\n\n<p>Women:</p>\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-gallery has-nested-images columns-default is-cropped\">\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><a href=\"https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/bikeskills-web.firebasestorage.app/o/wp-content%2Fuploads%2F2022%2F09%2F20220924_144148-scaled.webp?alt=media\"><img src=\"https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/bikeskills-web.firebasestorage.app/o/wp-content%2Fuploads%2F2022%2F09%2F20220924_144148.webp?alt=media\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-212103\"/></a></figure>\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><a href=\"https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/bikeskills-web.firebasestorage.app/o/wp-content%2Fuploads%2F2022%2F09%2F20220924_144311-scaled.webp?alt=media\"><img src=\"https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/bikeskills-web.firebasestorage.app/o/wp-content%2Fuploads%2F2022%2F09%2F20220924_144311.webp?alt=media\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-212106\"/></a></figure>\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><a href=\"https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/bikeskills-web.firebasestorage.app/o/wp-content%2Fuploads%2F2022%2F09%2F20220924_143435-scaled.webp?alt=media\"><img src=\"https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/bikeskills-web.firebasestorage.app/o/wp-content%2Fuploads%2F2022%2F09%2F202209